  "helpHomeSummary": "Your net worth: everything you own minus everything you owe, with the cards you use most.",
  "helpHomeStep1Title": "Net worth",
  "helpHomeStep1Body": "Tap it to open the balance sheet: what you own and what you owe, item by item.",
  "helpHomeStep2Title": "Your cards",
  "helpHomeStep2Body": "Accounts, Left to spend, Coming up and others appear as you use them. Tap a card to open it.",
  "helpHomeStep3Title": "Edit Home",
  "helpHomeStep3Body": "Move cards or hide the ones you don’t need. Qima never adds back a card you hid.",
  "helpHomeStep4Title": "Hide balances",
  "helpHomeStep4Body": "Tap the eye to mask every amount, for when someone is looking.",
  "helpHomeStep5Title": "Add anything",
  "helpHomeStep5Body": "Tap + for a transaction, a statement, a holding, or anything under More.",
